{
  "name": "Cloud Office Print - Document Generation to XLSX (basic)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Basic example: fill an Excel template and save the result\n\nThe smallest useful workflow. Template and the data are both stored inside this workflow, so it runs as soon as you add your Cloud Office Print credential.\n\n### Setup\n1. Open the Cloud Office Print node and pick your credential.\n2. Click **Execute workflow**.\n3. Open the Convert to File node and download `invoice.xlsx` from its output panel.",
        "height": 512,
        "width": 820,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        0
      ],
      "id": "690db5c4-b212-457a-8a81-c9a9ec42926e",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        1274
      ],
      "id": "7bd88381-ccf6-4dda-8bf0-fb47cdb38e39",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Trigger\n\nRuns on demand. Nothing to configure.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        542
      ],
      "id": "5139edd6-7742-419f-83a7-3df8c6d6998f",
      "name": "Sticky Note - When clicking 'Execute workflow'"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "documentGeneration",
        "operation": "general",
        "template": {
          "fileConfig": {
            "fileData": "",
            "mimeType": "xlsx"
          }
        },
        "data": "{\n  \"cust_city\": \"St. Louis\",\n  \"cust_first_name\": \"Albertos\",\n  \"cust_last_name\": \"Lambert\",\n  \"orders\": [\n    {\n      \"order_name\": \"Order 1\",\n      \"order_total\": 950,\n      \"product\": [\n        {\n          \"product_name\": \"Business \\nShirt\",\n          \"quantity\": 3,\n          \"unit_price\": 50\n        },\n        {\n          \"product_name\": \"Trousers\",\n          \"quantity\": 2,\n          \"unit_price\": 80\n        },\n        {\n          \"product_name\": \"Jacket\",\n          \"quantity\": 2,\n          \"unit_price\": 150\n        },\n        {\n          \"product_name\": \"Blouse\",\n          \"quantity\": 3,\n          \"unit_price\": 60\n        },\n        {\n          \"product_name\": \"Skirt\",\n          \"quantity\": 2,\n          \"unit_price\": 80\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "outputFileName": "invoice",
        "outputType": "xlsx"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cloudofficeprint.cloudOfficePrint",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        1274
      ],
      "id": "05453a20-402f-406f-82ce-d1a44780f8ff",
      "name": "Generate XLSX from template"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fill the template\n\nResource Document Generation.\n\n**Base64 Encoded File** holds `invoice-template.xlsx` pasted in directly, with **File Type** `xlsx`. The other examples fetch this from Drive instead.\n\n**Data (JSON)** holds the sample data. Its keys match the template tags: `cust_first_name`, `cust_city`, and an `orders` array with a `product` array inside it.\n\n**Output Type** `xlsx`. Change it to `pdf`, `csv` or `html` and the same data and template produce that format instead.\n\nThe result comes back as Base64 in `body`.",
        "height": 692,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        542
      ],
      "id": "c76382be-bb3f-4623-8ddc-d4037ee66bf4",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Generate XLSX from template"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "body",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "invoice.xlsx",
          "mimeType": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        560,
        1274
      ],
      "id": "0c919ca0-63c2-4b69-8a7d-3042c6056996",
      "name": "Base64 result to XLSX file"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Base64 to file\n\nConvert to File, operation Move Base64 String to File.\n\nBase64 Input Field: `body`\nPut Output File in Field: `data`\n\nRun the workflow, then use the download icon on the **Binary** tab of this node to save `invoice.xlsx`.\n\nAdd a Google Drive, Dropbox or Gmail node after this to deliver the file somewhere.",
        "height": 378,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        542
      ],
      "id": "48fda875-d160-4f15-8ae0-6ac7fe9f21de",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Base64 result to XLSX file"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
